/v1/","context":{"app_id":1715630,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-1715630-1847286114038758","game_id":"steam-1715630","kind":"announcement","title":"Forge Friday #03: Fixes First, New UI Next","summary":"Forge Friday is a day late this week, and so was Demo 0.1.35. We found some nasty crash bugs and held the release until they were fixed. It's out now, Steam Next Fest runs until Monday, and we have news about the UI. Demo 0.1.35: Orders Up This update is about getting your settlers moving, and about keeping the game running. Stability first. Fixes for severe stutter, slowdowns while moving around the world, and several crashes, including one when saving after traveling far away and coming back. ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T05:06:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114038758","verified_at":"2026-10-24T09:43:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1715630-1847286114038729","game_id":"steam-1715630","kind":"announcement","title":"TimbrianGuard Demo 0.1.35: Orders Up","summary":"Demo 0.1.35 is all about getting your settlers moving. Hover a target to attack, move or chop, give priority orders that make settlers drop what they're doing, and craft everything from a new Crafting tab in Production. Settlers work smarter, trees and bushes yield more, and a long list of fixes tackles stutter and crashes. Highlights Quicker orders. With settlers selected, hover a target to attack, move or chop. Priority orders make settlers drop what they're doing, and Explore no longer needs ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T04:46:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114038729","verified_at":"2026-10-24T09:43:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1715630-1846651706692373","game_id":"steam-1715630","kind":"announcement","title":"TimbrianGuard Public Demo — Live","summary":"Join RE³ Studios live as we play the free TimbrianGuard public demo during Steam Next Fest. Watch the opening days of a colony, ask questions, and try the demo from the TimbrianGuard Steam store page.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T19:15:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692373","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1715630-1846651706691625","game_id":"steam-1715630","kind":"announcement","title":"The TimbrianGuard Public Demo Is Available Now","summary":"The free TimbrianGuard Public Demo is available now on Steam. Build your starting encampment, look after the people who live there, and see what it takes to get a colony through its opening days. We're also taking part in Steam Next Fest, October 19–26. Two ways to begin Survival: Guide eight starting settlers through the first three full in-game days. Assign roles, gather sticks and stones, make tools, establish a camp, and prepare for the dangers that arrive after dark. Day-by-day goals help y","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:10:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691625","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1715630-1846651706680260","game_id":"steam-1715630","kind":"announcement","title":"Forge Friday #02: Ready for Next Fest","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46237442/422d498d600952d1263eac5d00a35ed31b9df3de.jpg Steam Next Fest starts Monday, and so does the free TimbrianGuard demo. Here's what changed in the week since Forge Friday #01: five demo builds, a fresh look for the store page, and more than 250 changes and fixes. The demo goes live Monday, October 19 TimbrianGuard is an open world colony survival game. The free single-player demo launches with Steam Next Fest (October 19–26): Survival: the first three in-game days, about","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T06:29:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706680260","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1715630-1846018067931678","game_id":"steam-1715630","kind":"announcement","title":"Forge Friday #01: A Long Time Coming","summary":"It's been a busy six weeks, and most of it hasn't reached Steam yet. Here's the catch-up: a new name, a free demo for Steam Next Fest, and a look at the colony systems we've been building for it. Satus is now TimbrianGuard When we named the game Satus, we were thinking about beginnings. The game has grown since then, and we wanted a name that speaks to more of what you do in it: build a world and look after the people who live there. Timbrian is Old English for \"to build\". Add the guard, and tha","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T23:41:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067931678","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1715630-1845383656397545","game_id":"steam-1715630","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest Alpha 0.2 — Raise the Roof","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46237442/3dde78c6cedcae97be990ce2c3bd5677f69eff32.png Playtest Alpha 0.2 is out now. This is our biggest building update yet. Draw your rooms, roof them in one go, carve in the fine detail, then save the whole thing as a blueprint, edit it in its own sandbox world and drop it anywhere. The land shapes itself around it. This is the last planned Playtest update, so jump in while you can. Smarter roofs Auto roof connects a roof across your rooms, including complex layouts. Set a ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T20:41:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656397545","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1715630-1842212951297747","game_id":"steam-1715630","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest 0.1.15 — Rebuilt from the Ground Up","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46237442/6b9a6e027c4eecf67ea0904c121bb6ea8e3a1771.png We heard you. The UI was terrible, confusing, and just didn't feel like a game. So we rebuilt it from the ground up. Try the creative alpha with a fresh set of tools that simplifies the building experience and helps guide you with major menu refreshes, better event feedback, more guides, improved blueprints, camera controls, world previews, and terrain tools. Oh, and we also made a broad collection of performance, UI, asset","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T17:56:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951297747","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1715630-1840310314346300","game_id":"steam-1715630","kind":"announcement","title":"Creative Alpha: Build the World Before Survival Begins","summary":"Satus Creative Alpha is our free public building workshop: a place to explore procedural voxel worlds, experiment with our creative tools, and create blueprints while the larger colony-survival experience is being developed. What Can You Do in Creative Alpha? You can generate and explore voxel worlds, build and terraform freely, experiment with early entities and commands, and create reusable blueprints that can be shared with other players. In the coming weeks, we’ll also begin: Regular communi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-07T21:43:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314346300","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-1715630":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T23:59:06Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-25T23:59:04Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-1715630":"2026-10-25T23:59:06Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"1715630":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T23:59:04Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T23:59:04Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5083070":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T23:59:06Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T23:59:06Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-1715630","app_id":1715630,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:06Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"35362e17e4cb5cb4a609e0e7fb75d514e88532e61817718cbde9ceee12dcc181","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Build a colony that is yours, block by block.  Shape the terrain and craft detailed homes with sub-voxel building tools, then assign settlers to gather, craft, and prepare for the night.  Lead eight settlers in Survival or build freely in an unlimited sandbox.","publishers":[{"name":"Re³ Studios"}],"developers":[{"name":"Re³ Studios"}],"franc